        "x1": 0.8840375816993463,
        "y1": 0.91477398989899
      },
      "text": "Remark 5.5. Our proof will show that Γ = Γ1 × Γ2 × . . . × Γn has C∗-ISR property if every Γi is a torsion-free non-amenable acylindrically hyperbolic group with property-AP.",
